# Relative percentage addition at zero and whole boundaries

Verifies relative addition with zero, one hundred, and more than one hundred percent. The cases pin identity, doubling, and growth beyond twice the original decimal magnitude.

>>> source
const value: decimal = 12.50
print(value + 0%)
print(value + 100%)
print(value + 150%)

<<< stdout
12.50
25.00
31.2500

<<< stderr
